TranslationUnitDecl
|-FunctionTemplateDecl count
| |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 ... Ts
| `-FunctionDecl count 'unsigned long (Ts...)'
|   |-ParmVarDecl referenced ts 'Ts...' pack
|   `-CompoundStmt
|     `-ReturnStmt
|       `-BinaryOperator 'unsigned long' '+'
|         |-SizeOfPackExpr 'unsigned long' Ts
|         `-SizeOfPackExpr 'unsigned long' ts
`-FunctionTemplateDecl g
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 0 T
  |-TemplateTypeParmDecl referenced class depth 0 index 1 ... Ts
  `-FunctionDecl g 'void (T, Ts &...)'
    |-ParmVarDecl t 'T'
    `-ParmVarDecl rest 'Ts &...' pack
